OL,3,GNEWSAAward for firm detecting illegal
OL,4,Aghost plates
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Kent company has won a national prize
OL,7,Ffor developing technology to crack down
OL,8,Fon illegal registration plates.
OL,10,FDartford's MAV Systems has been awarded
OL,11,F'Innovation of the Year' at the 2026
OL,12,FMade in Britain Impact Awards for its
OL,13,Fautomatic number plate recognition
OL,14,F(ANPR) cameras.
OL,16,FTwo years in the making, they detect
OL,17,Fcloned, disguised or deliberately
OL,18,Fmanipulated 'ghost' plates, which are
OL,19,Fdesigned to evade standard traffic
OL,20,Fcameras - with one deployment detecting
OL,21,F628 suspected offenders in just 14
OL,22,Fdays.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
