OL,5,
OL,6,F"Our technology can see through those
OL,7,Fevasive techniques and give the police
OL,8,Fand local authorities an added
OL,9,Fadvantage," said Helen Garrett, MAV's
OL,10,Finternational business development
OL,11,Fmanager.
